  "classifiedOn": "basic_category",
  "notes": [
    "Every mapping entry names an Overture `basic_category` value verified to exist in the pinned release, together with the `taxonomy.hierarchy[0]` root it was observed under. The root is a guard, not a selector: if Overture moves a category to a different root the extractor reports it rather than silently reclassifying.",
    "Exclusivity is structural. Overture gives each place exactly one `basic_category`, and each `basic_category` appears in exactly one DreamDestination bucket below, so a place can never be counted in two buckets or twice in one.",
    "The deprecated `categories` property is not used anywhere. Overture removes it in September 2026.",
    "A place whose `basic_category` is absent from this file is unclassified and enters no bucket. It is never guessed at from the venue name or from `taxonomy.alternates`.",
    "These buckets are DreamDestination product definitions, not Overture concepts. Overture has no notion of `nightlife` or `community_spaces`."
  ],
  "excluded": {
    "notes": [
      "Categories deliberately left out of `shopping`, so the bucket describes retail people choose to visit rather than errands. Recorded here so the omission is auditable rather than invisible."
    ],
